{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_132_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_132","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_132_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_132","textTraditional":"十有八年春，晉侯、衛世子臧伐齊。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_132_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_132","textTraditional":"公伐杞。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_132_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_132","textTraditional":"夏，四月。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_132_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_132","textTraditional":"秋，七月，邾人戕鄫子于鄫。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_132_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_132","textTraditional":"甲戌，楚子旅卒。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_132_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_132","textTraditional":"公孫歸父如晉。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_132_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_132","textTraditional":"冬，十月壬戌，公薨于路寢。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_132_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_132","textTraditional":"歸父還自晉，至笙。遂奔齊，","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_ttr_132_10","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_132","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_ttr_132_11","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_132","textTraditional":"十八年春，晉侯、衛大子臧伐齊，至于陽穀。齊侯會晉侯盟于繒，以公子彊為質于晉。晉師還。蔡朝、南郭偃逃歸。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_ttr_132_12","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_132","textTraditional":"夏，公使如楚乞師，欲以伐齊。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_ttr_132_13","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_132","textTraditional":"秋，邾人戕鄫子于鄫。凡自虐其君曰弒，自外曰戕。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_ttr_132_14","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_132","textTraditional":"楚莊王卒，楚師不出，既而用晉師。楚於是乎有蜀之役。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_ttr_132_15","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_132","textTraditional":"公孫歸父以襄仲之立公也，有寵，欲去三桓，以張公室。與公謀而聘于晉，欲以晉人去之。冬，公薨。季文子言於朝曰：「使我殺適立庶，以失大援者，仲也夫。」臧宣叔怒曰：「當其時，不能治也，後之人何罪？子欲去之，許請去之。」遂逐東門氏。子家還，及笙，壇帷，復命於介。既復命，袒、括髮，即位哭，三踊而出。遂奔齊。書曰「歸父還自晉。」善之也。","sentenceOrder":15}],"overrides":{}}